B.aKt=new A.d7("impact","InsightValues Impact","InsightValues Impact",B.mq,!0,!1,B.b2,"/impact",B.ape,B.H,!1,"IV-IMPACT-I1: n\xfacleo de evid\xeancia/verifica\xe7\xe3o + persist\xeancia Lab (migration n\xe3o aplicada em produ\xe7\xe3o, RLS testada em PostgreSQL descart\xe1vel) + Edge Function impact-lab s\xf3 para admin (n\xe3o deployada). Sem rede, sem LLM. N\xe3o emite veredito, score ou ranking; aus\xeancia de evid\xeancia nunca vira acusa\xe7\xe3o. I5: tela de dossi\xea s\xf3 para admin (/impact), consumindo o contrato I4.","IV-IMPACT-I1: evidence/verification core + Lab persistence (migration not applied to production, RLS tested on a disposable PostgreSQL) + admin-only impact-lab Edge Function (not deployed). No network, no LLM. Emits no verdict, score or ranking; absence of evidence never becomes an accusation. I5: admin-only dossier screen (/impact) consuming the I4 contract.","Impact Lab (branch claude/insightvalues-impact-foundation). A\xe7\xf5es classe C (acusa\xe7\xe3o p\xfablica, contato externo, doa\xe7\xe3o) N\xc3O implementadas -- futuramente somente via AEF + Human Gate. I5: adminClickable=true (tela de dossi\xea admin-only; a autoridade real \xe9 o entitlement admin do impact-lab).",null)
