B.aK9=new A.d7("ive-strategy-simulation","Simula\xe7\xe3o de Estrat\xe9gia (AEF)","Strategy Simulation (AEF)",B.hy,!1,!1,B.b2,null,B.ao2,B.H,!1,"BETA CONTROLADO (INSIGHTVALUES-FINANCIAL-PRODUCT-MACRO-08): a computa\xe7\xe3o real da simula\xe7\xe3o (determin\xedstica, in-process, sem broker, sem dado externo) roda dentro de strategy-builder (`run_simulation`, Premium), reaproveitando o mesmo motor gen\xe9rico do backtest, mas gravada com categoria SIMULATION (nunca BACKTEST, discriminador n\xe3o-contorn\xe1vel desde a corre\xe7\xe3o da auditoria Codex) em strategy_experiments. Este m\xf3dulo separado \xe9 a ponte de governan\xe7a AEF (`approve_simulation_result` -> internal.mock_strategy_simulation_approval, CONSEQUENTIAL, Human Gate obrigat\xf3rio) que demonstra a cadeia Simula\xe7\xe3o -> Action Intent -> AEF -> receipt -> learning ponta a ponta. Promovido de EXPERIMENTAL/admin-only para BETA/beta_tester nesta miss\xe3o -- N\xc3O promovido a COMMERCIAL porque isso violaria a prote\xe7\xe3o MP-03/MP-09 do pr\xf3prio module_policy_test.ts (nenhum m\xf3dulo CONSEQUENTIAL pode ser RC/COMMERCIAL enquanto AEF_PERSISTENCE_AVAILABLE=false) -- flipar essa flag \xe9 uma decis\xe3o arquitetural de infraestrutura AEF de produ\xe7\xe3o, fora do escopo desta miss\xe3o, e n\xe3o foi tomada silenciosamente aqui. LAB-only, bloqueada de deploy (scripts/ci/resolve_deploy_selection.sh), mock-only. Sem tela dedicada -- fluxo embutido no Strategy Lab.","CONTROLLED BETA (INSIGHTVALUES-FINANCIAL-PRODUCT-MACRO-08): the actual simulation computation (deterministic, in-process, no broker, no external data) runs inside strategy-builder (`run_simulation`, Premium), reusing the same generic backtest engine but recorded with category SIMULATION (never BACKTEST, a non-bypassable discriminator since the Codex audit fix) in strategy_experiments. This separate module is the AEF governance bridge (`approve_simulation_result` -> internal.mock_strategy_simulation_approval, CONSEQUENTIAL, mandatory Human Gate) demonstrating the Simulation -> Action Intent -> AEF -> receipt -> learning chain end to end. Promoted from EXPERIMENTAL/admin-only to BETA/beta_tester this mission -- NOT promoted to COMMERCIAL because that would violate module_policy_test.ts's own MP-03/MP-09 guardrail (no CONSEQUENTIAL module may be RC/COMMERCIAL while AEF_PERSISTENCE_AVAILABLE=false) -- flipping that flag is a production AEF infrastructure architectural decision out of this mission's scope, not made silently here. LAB-only, deploy-blocked (scripts/ci/resolve_deploy_selection.sh), mock-only. No dedicated screen -- the flow is embedded in Strategy Lab.","CONSEQUENTIAL (servidor: module_policy.ts), mesma classe de ive-quant. Categoricamente sem caminho para um broker, uma ordem ou execu\xe7\xe3o live/paper -- ver TRADING_BOUNDARY (\xa753) e RU-30 (runtime_unit_test.ts): a action table s\xf3 reconhece approve_simulation_result. ESCALA\xc7\xc3O ARQUITETURAL registrada no relat\xf3rio final do Macro-08: promo\xe7\xe3o a COMMERCIAL exige decis\xe3o do Owner/Agente Martins sobre AEF_PERSISTENCE_AVAILABLE.",B.Rt)
